drawdy-doom
===========

This extension bundles a compiled copy of DOOM.

  Engine   doom.wasm — https://github.com/jacobenget/doom.wasm  (v0.1.0)
           id Software's DOOM sources by way of doomgeneric, compiled to a
           single freestanding WebAssembly module. Fetched at build time and
           pinned by SHA-256 (see scripts/fetch-doom-wasm.mjs).

  Game     The DOOM shareware WAD is embedded inside that wasm module. It is
           Episode 1, "Knee-Deep in the Dead", which id Software released as
           freely redistributable shareware. Episodes 2 and 3 are not included.
           Point the console's WAD picker at a DOOM.WAD, DOOM2.WAD or
           freedoom.wad you own to play those instead.

